{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"部分段落把注意力转向记忆能否留存、能否重新拥有，以及如何安放失去后的经历，但这些仍然围绕亲密幸福与不可复得的痛楚展开。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"主线逐渐转向当下亲密关系中的自我暴露、害怕显得过度依赖、猜测对方是否同样需要自己，以及渴望得到长久承诺。\",\n    \"痛楚更多来自对未来被冷落、被不再需要的预期焦虑，而不是亲密幸福本身与无法留住这份幸福的痛楚相互交织。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X从头到尾都在处理同一份亲密所带来的幸福，以及它无法重新拥有、无法永久留存的痛楚，两者反复相互渗透。Y虽然也有亲密的幸福和失去的恐惧，但逐渐把关系中的依赖感、被需要的确认和对未来承诺的焦虑变成了主线。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f7b46206-9bf7-497e-808c-e1e45aab3908", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T080756091147Z", "elapsed_seconds": 14.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:08:10.421098+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "04f696bc140eee06c4dfe157edde2075f40caa86bcba0e4431c826b3c7132627", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4